1
00:00:00,100 --> 00:00:05,250
Today we will look at how water moves around our planet.

2
00:00:05,200 --> 00:00:11,150
The sun heats the ocean, and water evaporates into the air.

3
00:00:11,150 --> 00:00:16,033
Higher up, the vapour cools and forms clouds.

4
00:00:16,033 --> 00:00:22,133
Finally, precipitation returns the water to the land and sea.

